        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠠᠷᠨᠢ ᠎ᠶᠢᠨ ᠺᠦᠷᠳᠦᠨ</unicode>
          <definition>talisman, prière mystique</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠡᠯᠭᠡᠷᠡᠩᠭᠦᠢ ᠎ᠶᠢᠨ ᠳᠠᠷᠨᠢ</unicode>
          <definition>formule magique qui procure l'opulence</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠣᠭᠰᠢᠨ ᠳᠠᠷᠨᠢ</unicode>
